{"id":"7640f770f9f763e9","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-dedekind-modular.md","title":"thm-dedekind-modular","display":"thm-dedekind-modular","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-lattice]]","[[93-df-modular]]"],"display":"thm-dedekind-modular","label":"93-thm-dedekind-modular","aliases":["93-thm-dedekind-modular"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c4f99f2719ded5b\" href=\"?note=0c4f99f2719ded5b\" title=\"93-df-modular\">93-df-modular</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dedekind-modular"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-dedekind-modular"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-dedekind-modular</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-dedekind-modular-thm-dedekind-modular\">thm-dedekind-modular <code>thm-dedekind-modular</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span> is a lattice candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf L|\">\\(x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf L|\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}\\)</span> denotes the modular-lattice predicate.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> is the lattice class of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}modular}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\n\\Bigl(x\\leq_{\\mathbf L}z\\to\nx\\vee^{\\mathbf L}(y\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}z)=\n(x\\vee^{\\mathbf L}y)\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}z\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}modular}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\n\\Bigl(x\\leq_{\\mathbf L}z\\to\nx\\vee^{\\mathbf L}(y\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}z)=\n(x\\vee^{\\mathbf L}y)\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}z\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is the Dedekind modular identity.  No modularity claim is made for an arbitrary subalgebra lattice.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-dedekind-modular-thm-dedekind-modular","text":"thm-dedekind-modular `thm-dedekind-modular`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-modular","status":"resolved","id":"0c4f99f2719ded5b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-modular]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf L","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf L|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}modular}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\n\\Bigl(x\\leq_{\\mathbf L}z\\to\nx\\vee^{\\mathbf L}(y\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}z)=\n(x\\vee^{\\mathbf L}y)\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}z\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":889,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["3b5f38bd115ed203","0c4f99f2719ded5b"]}